  "content": "\n\n<p>你想要在《Minecraft》中使用<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> </span>爆炸箭還是會追蹤生物的箭呢？</p>\n<p>這個模式就是為你而設的 :D</p>\n<pre><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">本模組包含<span style=\"color:#fff\"> <span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">17</span> </span></span>種全新<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">箭矢</span>、<span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">4</span> </span></span>種不同類型的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> <span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">箭袋</span></span></span>、一張新弓、一項全新的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">箭矢附魔</span></span></span>、數種<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">新藥水與箭矢效果</span></span></span>以及特殊實體：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> <span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">龍捲風</span>.</span></span></strong></pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:320px\">&nbsp; 更多詳細資訊：&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">箭矢：</span></h3>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#87dae8\"><span style=\"color:#ff8412\">銅箭</span></span></span></span> (傷害略高)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#87dae8\"><span style=\"color:#ff8412\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> </span></span>冰箭</span></span></span> (減速並傷害生物)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#ff9712\">火箭</span></span></span> (點燃生物)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> <span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#dc2e1a\">爆炸箭</span> </span></span> (中等爆炸)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">閃電箭</span>&nbsp;</span></span> (以閃電劈擊生物)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">重箭</span> </span> (高擊退)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">末影箭</span></span> (效果類似末影珍珠)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">龍捲風箭</span></span> (召喚龍捲風)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">重力箭</span> </span> (漂浮)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">迅捷箭</span></span> (速度更快)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> <span style=\"color:#169179\">大箭</span> </span> (中等擊退、穿透)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">超級爆炸箭</span> </span> (更大爆炸)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> <span style=\"color:#ff1500\">極致爆炸箭</span></span> (超大型爆炸、特殊功能)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">自動追蹤箭</span> </span> (追蹤最近的生物)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">多重追蹤箭</span> </span> (多支箭矢同時出擊，攻擊附近敵人)， <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#fa5b19\">爆炸追蹤箭</span> </span> (追蹤最近生物並爆炸)，<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> <span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">隨機箭 </span></span> (隨機使用某支自訂箭矢，或附加特殊效果)</h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">未來更新：</span></h3>\n<h4><em><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">-全新的箭矢打造器與箭矢配方書</span></em></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">取得模組網站存取權：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/mod-site-112312683?utm_medium=clipboard_copy&utm_source=copyLink&utm_campaign=postshare_creator&utm_content=join_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">按此處</a></h3>",
